{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The proverbs of Solomon.\nA wise son maketh a glad father;\nBut a foolish son is the heaviness of his mother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Treasures of wickedness profit nothing;\nBut righteousness delivereth from death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish;\nBut he thrusteth away the desire of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He becometh poor that worketh with a slack hand;\nBut the hand of the diligent maketh rich.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that gathereth in summer is a wise son;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that sleepeth in harvest is a son that causeth shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessings are upon the head of the righteous;\nBut violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The memory of the righteous is blessed;\nBut the name of the wicked shall rot.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wise in heart will receive commandments;\nBut a prating fool shall fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that walketh uprightly walketh surely;\nBut he that perverteth his ways shall be known.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow;\nBut a prating fool shall fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mouth of the righteous is a fountain of life;\nBut violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hatred stirreth up strifes;\nBut love covereth all transgressions.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the lips of him that hath discernment wisdom is found;\nBut a rod is for the back of him that is void of understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wise men lay up knowledge;\nBut the mouth of the foolish is a present destruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rich man’s wealth is his strong city:\nThe destruction of the poor is their poverty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The labor of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to life;\nThe increase of the wicked, to sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is in the way of life that heedeth correction;\nBut he that forsaketh reproof erreth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hideth hatred is of lying lips;\nAnd he that uttereth a slander is a fool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the multitude of words there wanteth not transgression;\nBut he that refraineth his lips doeth wisely.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The tongue of the righteous is ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " choice silver:\nThe heart of the wicked is little worth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The lips of the righteous feed many;\nBut the foolish die for lack of understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The blessing of Jehovah, it maketh rich;\nAnd he addeth no sorrow therewith.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is as sport to a fool to do wickedness;And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wisdom to a man of understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him;\nAnd the desire of the righteous shall be granted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the whirlwind passeth, the wicked is no more;\nBut the righteous is an everlasting foundation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes,\nSo is the sluggard to them that send him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah prolongeth days;\nBut the years of the wicked shall be shortened.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The hope of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gladness;\nBut the expectation of the wicked shall perish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of Jehovah is a stronghold to the upright;\nBut it is a destruction to the workers of iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous shall never be removed;\nBut the wicked shall not dwell in the land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mouth of the righteous bringeth forth wisdom;\nBut the perverse tongue shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.10.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.10.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable;\nBut the mouth of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "speaketh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perverseness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
